{"seq":2,"slug":"regularization","title":"正则化与 Dropout","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/dl-training-optimization/stabilization/regularization","wordCount":1538,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"正则化与-dropout\">正则化与 Dropout</h1><p><a href=\"normalization\">归一化</a>解决的是「能不能稳定地训下去」，而正则化解决的是另一类崩坏：训练损失一路下降，验证损失却越来越差——模型把训练集背了下来，却没学到能迁移到新数据的规律。这正是<a href=\"../foundations/optimization-landscape\">经验风险与期望风险之间的鸿沟</a>在作祟。正则化是一组专门压缩这道鸿沟、改善泛化的技术。这一节讲清从权重衰减到 Dropout 再到标签平滑、数据增强的主要手段，以及它们各自抑制过拟合的原理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-偏差-方差与过拟合\">核心概念：偏差—方差与过拟合</h2><p>模型的泛化误差可以粗分为偏差（模型太简单、欠拟合）与方差（模型太敏感、过拟合）两部分。深度网络参数极多、容量极大，天然偏向高方差——足以记住训练集的噪声细节。正则化的本质，就是给优化过程加约束或扰动，限制模型的有效容量，把它从「死记硬背」推向「学习规律」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[过拟合&lt;br/&gt;训练损失低 验证损失高] --&gt; B{正则化手段}&#10;  B --&gt; C[权重衰减&lt;br/&gt;约束参数规模]&#10;  B --&gt; D[Dropout&lt;br/&gt;随机丢弃神经元]&#10;  B --&gt; E[标签平滑&lt;br/&gt;软化目标分布]&#10;  B --&gt; F[数据增强&lt;br/&gt;扩充等价样本]&#10;  B --&gt; G[早停&lt;br/&gt;验证损失回升即停]&#10;  C --&gt; H[更小的有效容量]&#10;  D --&gt; H&#10;  E --&gt; H&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[更好的泛化]\">flowchart TD\n  A[过拟合&lt;br/&gt;训练损失低 验证损失高] --&gt; B{正则化手段}\n  B --&gt; C[权重衰减&lt;br/&gt;约束参数规模]\n  B --&gt; D[Dropout&lt;br/&gt;随机丢弃神经元]\n  B --&gt; E[标签平滑&lt;br/&gt;软化目标分布]\n  B --&gt; F[数据增强&lt;br/&gt;扩充等价样本]\n  B --&gt; G[早停&lt;br/&gt;验证损失回升即停]\n  C --&gt; H[更小的有效容量]\n  D --&gt; H\n  E --&gt; H\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[更好的泛化]</pre><p>值得强调的是，前面已出现的几项手段也属于正则化范畴：小批量 SGD 的<a href=\"../foundations/gradient-descent-variants\">梯度噪声</a>是隐式正则化，而<a href=\"normalization\">归一化</a>也带有轻微的正则效果。本节聚焦那些「显式以泛化为目的」的技术。</p>\n<h2 id=\"权重衰减-最基础的约束\">权重衰减：最基础的约束</h2><p>权重衰减在每步更新时把参数朝零拉一点，等价于在损失里加一个 L2 惩罚项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>θ</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\lambda}{2}\\|\\theta\\|^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2251em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。直觉是：参数越小，函数越平滑、对输入扰动越不敏感，因而泛化越好。它几乎是所有训练的标配。</p>\n<p>但如<a href=\"../optimizers/adaptive-adam\">优化器章</a>反复强调的，「权重衰减」与「L2 正则」在自适应优化器下并不等价——把惩罚加进损失（耦合 L2）会被 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{\\hat{v}_t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1828em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8572em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8172em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1828em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 缩放而失真，所以现代实践用 <a href=\"../optimizers/adaptive-adam\">AdamW</a> 的解耦衰减直接作用于参数。一个常见工程细节是：归一化层的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma,\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 和偏置通常不施加权重衰减，只对权重矩阵衰减，否则会损害归一化的表达能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dropout-随机丢弃的集成视角\">Dropout：随机丢弃的集成视角</h2><p>Dropout 在训练时以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 随机把一部分神经元的输出置零，每个 batch 丢弃的子集都不同。它的效果可以从两个角度理解。一是「防共适应」：神经元无法依赖某个特定伙伴总是在场，被迫各自学出更鲁棒、冗余的特征。二是「隐式集成」：每次随机丢弃相当于训练了一个不同的子网络，推理时不丢弃则近似在指数多个子网络上做平均。</p>\n<p>为保持训练与推理时输出期望一致，主流实现用「倒置 Dropout」：训练时把保留的激活除以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1-p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，推理时则原样通过、无需改动。下表是几种正则化手段的速查：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>作用对象</th>\n<th>典型超参</th>\n<th>主要场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>权重衰减</td>\n<td>权重参数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda\\in[10^{-2},10^{-1}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>（AdamW）</td>\n<td>几乎所有训练</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dropout</td>\n<td>神经元输出</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p\\in[0.1,0.5]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>全连接、注意力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标签平滑</td>\n<td>目标标签</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon\\in[0.1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>分类、翻译</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据增强</td>\n<td>输入样本</td>\n<td>任务相关</td>\n<td>视觉、语音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>早停</td>\n<td>训练时长</td>\n<td>验证集监控</td>\n<td>数据量小时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>需要注意 Dropout 与 BatchNorm 同用时常有冲突（二者对方差的处理相互干扰），实践中要么调整顺序，要么在用了强归一化的网络里降低甚至去掉 Dropout——这是为什么很多现代视觉网络几乎不用 Dropout，而 Transformer 仍保留较低的 Dropout 率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"标签平滑-数据增强与早停\">标签平滑、数据增强与早停</h2><p>标签平滑把 one-hot 的硬标签软化：正确类别从 1 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span>，其余类别平分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span>。这阻止模型对预测过度自信、输出过于极端的 logits，既改善泛化也改善概率校准，在分类与机器翻译中广泛使用。</p>\n<p>数据增强从数据侧扩容：图像的翻转裁剪、文本的回译、语音的加噪，都是在制造「语义等价但形式不同」的样本，逼模型学到不变性而非记忆具体像素。对大语言模型而言，数据的多样性与去重本身就是最强的正则——这一点在<a href=\"../scaling/training-recipes\">训练配方</a>中会再提及。</p>\n<p>早停则最朴素：监控验证损失，一旦它开始回升就停止训练，等于把训练时长本身当作正则旋钮。它在数据量小、容易过拟合时尤其有效，但对动辄训练一遍数据的大模型预训练意义有限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规模如何改变正则化的角色\">规模如何改变正则化的角色</h2><p>一个值得点出的趋势是：随着模型与数据规模急剧增大，传统正则化的重要性在大模型预训练中有所下降。当训练数据足够多、几乎只过一遍（接近单 epoch）时，过拟合本就不易发生，强 Dropout 反而可能损害容量利用。此时主导泛化的因素转向数据质量、数据去重与规模本身，正则化更多退守到微调阶段。这并不意味着正则化过时，而是它的战场随规模迁移了——理解这种迁移，需要把它放到<a href=\"../scaling/large-batch-distributed\">规模与效率</a>的语境里看。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>正则化压缩经验风险与期望风险之间的泛化鸿沟，本质是限制模型有效容量，把死记硬背推向学习规律。</li>\n<li>权重衰减约束参数规模，现代实践用 AdamW 的解耦衰减，且通常不对归一化参数与偏置施加。</li>\n<li>Dropout 通过随机丢弃实现防共适应与隐式集成，与 BatchNorm 同用易冲突，强归一化网络常少用或不用。</li>\n<li>标签平滑软化目标、数据增强造等价样本、早停以验证损失为闸，各自从标签、数据、时长侧抑制过拟合。</li>\n<li>大模型近单 epoch 预训练下传统正则重要性下降，泛化更多由数据质量与规模主导，正则战场迁移到微调。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"正则化与 Dropout","id":"正则化与-dropout"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：偏差—方差与过拟合","id":"核心概念-偏差-方差与过拟合"},{"level":2,"text":"权重衰减：最基础的约束","id":"权重衰减-最基础的约束"},{"level":2,"text":"Dropout：随机丢弃的集成视角","id":"dropout-随机丢弃的集成视角"},{"level":2,"text":"标签平滑、数据增强与早停","id":"标签平滑-数据增强与早停"},{"level":2,"text":"规模如何改变正则化的角色","id":"规模如何改变正则化的角色"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"归一化方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/dl-training-optimization/stabilization/normalization"},"next":{"title":"初始化与残差","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/dl-training-optimization/stabilization/init-residual"}}